  abilities:
  - evidenceTypes: 02000000
    description: By activating his power, Runedrake can <color=#F9AB2D>light candles</color>
      that the malevolent spirit might <color=#F9AB2D>extinguish</color>.
  - evidenceTypes: 03000000
    description: The candles lit by Runedrake glow in a range of colors from red
      to blue to yellow, revealing the <color=#F9AB2D>temperature</color> of the
      room they're in. If they turn pink, the <color=#F9AB2D>temperature is freezing</color>.
